      null,
      "<p>Dear\nParticipants,</p>\n\n<p>We\nextend our warm invitation to you to participate in a survey to gather valuable\ninsights into your experiences and needs concerning elderly health monitoring\nand caregiving practices at the Home of the Aged in Metro Cebu. This survey is\nconducted as part of our study on ElderCareAI, which aims to develop a\nsmartwatch-based health monitoring system integrated with an AI-powered mobile\napplication for caregivers.</p>\n\n<p>The questionnaire should require approximately 5–10\nminutes of your time to complete.</p>\n\n<p>Your participation matters:</p>\n\n<p>Confidentiality and\nAnonymity: Rest assured that all your responses will be STRICTLY CONFIDENTIAL\nand ANONYMOUS.</p>\n\n<p> Data Security: The\nresearch team will be the sole entity accessing the survey data. Your privacy\nis our utmost priority.</p><p><span> No Personal Identifiers:\nNo personal names or identifying information will be used throughout our\nanalysis.</span></p>\n\n<p>Your insights are invaluable in helping us design a\nsystem that will improve the quality of care for elderly individuals. Your\nfeedback will contribute significantly to our ongoing efforts to enhance\nelderly monitoring and caregiver support.</p>\n\n<p>Survey Duration:\nApproximately 5–10 minutes.</p>\n\n<p>Confidentiality: Your\nresponses are strictly confidential and anonymous.</p><p><span>Access: The survey is\naccessible to the chosen participants.</span></p>\n\n<p>Your cooperation in this survey is deeply appreciated.\nThank you for investing your time and effort in assisting us in improving\nelderly health monitoring and caregiver support.</p>\n\n<p>Warm regards,</p>\n\n<p><b>The\nResearch Team</b></p>\n\n<p><b>Layos, Kristoffer James G.                                   Planos, John Wayne C.</b></p>\n\n<b>Bagonggong, Melvence R. </b>        "
    ],
